WEBVTT

01:30.470 --> 01:34.840
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.140 --> 01:37.800
[Episode 32]

01:38.870 --> 01:40.400
So your reckless flattery

01:40.420 --> 01:42.080
finally got you into trouble.

01:47.590 --> 01:48.400
It's alright. It's alright.

01:48.400 --> 01:49.840
I'm not really angry.

01:49.840 --> 01:51.200
You're quite cute actually,

01:51.200 --> 01:51.950
much better than

01:51.950 --> 01:53.680
that snide Ao Hen.

01:54.280 --> 01:54.840
Xiao Yao,

01:55.280 --> 01:56.880
did Ao Hen provoke you again?

01:57.789 --> 01:58.759
No, no, no.

01:58.759 --> 01:59.820
My spiritual power

01:59.920 --> 02:01.590
is too weak.

02:01.640 --> 02:03.150
It has nothing to do with Senior.

02:03.150 --> 02:04.040
It doesn't matter.

02:04.040 --> 02:05.150
As long as we are here,

02:05.150 --> 02:06.760
you are still unmatched in this world.

02:06.760 --> 02:07.230
Yes.

02:08.770 --> 02:10.000
I appreciate your kindness,

02:10.000 --> 02:12.530
but I think it's better
to cultivate on my own.

02:13.630 --> 02:14.400
Sister,

02:14.870 --> 02:16.280
let me teach you instead.

02:17.800 --> 02:18.430
Um,

02:18.910 --> 02:21.170
could you please stop calling me Sister?

02:22.560 --> 02:23.760
You said it yourself.

02:24.079 --> 02:24.630
If I don't

02:24.750 --> 02:26.150
call you Sister anymore,

02:26.280 --> 02:27.280
does that mean

02:27.280 --> 02:28.300
I can like you?

02:29.030 --> 02:31.079
What nonsense are you talking about?

02:31.079 --> 02:32.680
If anyone is teaching her, it will be me.

02:32.680 --> 02:34.120
Since when was it your turn?

02:34.120 --> 02:34.750
Qiong Qi,

02:35.000 --> 02:36.590
you can barely protect yourself,

02:36.590 --> 02:38.510
and you still have the nerve
to teach Xiao Yao.

02:38.510 --> 02:39.840
You're courting death.

02:41.560 --> 02:43.750
If Xiao Yao wishes to recover
her former spiritual power,

02:43.750 --> 02:45.280
then naturally I will be
the one to teach her.

02:45.280 --> 02:45.840
Fine.

02:46.190 --> 02:47.470
Get past me first before you say that.

02:47.470 --> 02:49.280
-Fine.
-I was the one who said it first.

02:49.280 --> 02:50.079
It has nothing to do with you.

02:50.079 --> 02:51.120
It has nothing to do with you.

02:51.120 --> 02:52.030
It has nothing to do with me?

02:52.030 --> 02:54.560
-I said it has nothing to do with you.
-Enough!

02:55.590 --> 02:56.860
If you three are too idle,

02:56.860 --> 02:58.780
then help us rebuild Demons' Valley.

02:58.780 --> 03:01.110
At least put that strength
of yours to use.

03:01.750 --> 03:03.810
I am not meant to handle menial tasks.

03:04.400 --> 03:05.200
Wouldn't that

03:05.750 --> 03:07.150
be a waste of my talents?

03:07.710 --> 03:10.000
But many places were destroyed by you.

03:11.400 --> 03:13.490
If you are unwilling to stay and help,

03:13.560 --> 03:14.710
please leave.

03:17.190 --> 03:18.430
Sister,

03:18.430 --> 03:19.290
don't be angry.

03:19.680 --> 03:21.030
I'll do whatever you ask me to.

03:21.030 --> 03:23.520
Can you stop calling me
"Sister" all the time?

03:23.520 --> 03:25.360
How old do you think
you are compared to me, anyway?

03:25.360 --> 03:26.150
My Lord!

03:28.470 --> 03:29.190
My Lord!

03:31.310 --> 03:33.710
Qiong Qi, Ao Hen, and Teng She

03:33.710 --> 03:36.030
are all repairing the barriers
throughout the valley.

03:36.030 --> 03:37.079
That's good.

03:37.520 --> 03:40.110
We don't have to rely solely on
your power anymore.

03:40.110 --> 03:41.340
I was worried

03:41.560 --> 03:43.910
that while you
were repairing the barriers,

03:43.910 --> 03:45.470
those three might launch a sneak attack,

03:45.470 --> 03:47.200
and we wouldn't know what to do.

03:47.360 --> 03:49.090
It seems I worried for nothing.

03:49.390 --> 03:50.240
Now things

03:50.280 --> 03:51.610
are finally evened out.

03:52.550 --> 03:54.010
But come to think of it,

03:54.190 --> 03:55.850
Xiao Yao is truly remarkable.

03:56.150 --> 03:58.360
She managed to make those
three fierce and ruthless beings

03:58.360 --> 03:59.490
obey her every word.

04:00.590 --> 04:01.910
I wonder

04:01.910 --> 04:03.280
what kind of tangled karma or bond

04:03.280 --> 04:05.080
the four of them shared

04:05.080 --> 04:06.910
ten thousand years ago.

04:08.030 --> 04:08.560
My Lord,

04:08.630 --> 04:09.120
I...

04:15.770 --> 04:18.800
The three old monsters have been
sealed away for ten thousand years.

04:18.800 --> 04:20.000
How could they possibly be a match

04:20.000 --> 04:20.950
for Your Lordship,

04:20.950 --> 04:23.350
who cultivates day and night without rest?

04:25.800 --> 04:27.200
When all is said and done,

04:27.450 --> 04:29.180
all of this is Xiao Yao's fault.

04:29.750 --> 04:30.750
Somehow she

04:31.000 --> 04:33.000
became entangled with those three.

04:33.040 --> 04:36.040
A hundred years ago,
she already betrayed your trust.

04:36.480 --> 04:37.220
And now,

04:37.630 --> 04:39.440
seeing their great power

04:39.830 --> 04:41.630
and how they obey her every word,

04:41.860 --> 04:43.000
she's playing both sides

04:43.000 --> 04:43.990
like the fickle woman she is.

04:43.990 --> 04:44.580
Silence!

04:45.740 --> 04:47.640
Xiao Yao doesn't even recognize them.

04:47.640 --> 04:48.960
How can you blame her?

04:51.210 --> 04:52.670
If it weren't for Xiao Yao,

04:53.070 --> 04:54.000
this calamity

04:54.510 --> 04:56.710
wouldn't have been resolved so easily.

04:57.800 --> 04:59.680
If I say something nice, it's wrong.

04:59.680 --> 05:02.010
If I say something harsh, it's also wrong.

05:02.310 --> 05:04.440
Your thoughts are truly hard to guess.

05:36.140 --> 05:37.740
I guess this is what they mean

05:37.960 --> 05:41.230
by "handsome as a jade tree
in the breeze."

05:42.770 --> 05:43.820
I'm so cultured!

06:08.030 --> 06:08.860
Senior,

06:08.960 --> 06:11.430
you've worked so hard
repairing the barrier.

06:11.430 --> 06:12.430
Try this.

06:13.800 --> 06:14.820
What's this?

06:14.870 --> 06:16.870
Food I saved from the humans.

06:16.890 --> 06:17.940
It's delicious.

06:18.000 --> 06:20.000
Especially this sugarcane. Try it.

06:21.120 --> 06:22.800
It's such an ugly thing.

06:23.580 --> 06:25.640
Just looking at it kills my appetite.

06:35.090 --> 06:36.550
What kind of treasure is this?

06:36.550 --> 06:37.210
Sugarcane.

06:37.330 --> 06:38.720
And this one's good too.

06:44.490 --> 06:45.240
Delicious.

06:48.950 --> 06:49.510
It tastes different.

06:49.510 --> 06:50.480
Good. It's really good.

06:50.480 --> 06:51.040
Not bad.

06:52.040 --> 06:53.040
Try this one.

06:53.040 --> 06:53.970
Is it delicious?

07:10.600 --> 07:12.780
Once mighty and proud across the realms,

07:12.780 --> 07:13.630
the demons have now

07:13.630 --> 07:15.690
been driven into such a small valley.

07:16.550 --> 07:18.080
It is truly a pitiful sight.

07:28.480 --> 07:29.160
Senior.

07:30.720 --> 07:31.270
Senior.

07:31.330 --> 07:31.990
Senior.

07:32.270 --> 07:34.570
Witnessing your power today

07:34.830 --> 07:35.950
has filled us with awe and admiration.

07:35.950 --> 07:36.510
Yes, yes.

07:37.390 --> 07:39.430
We humbly ask
if you would be willing to teach us,

07:39.430 --> 07:41.070
so that if humans invade again,

07:41.070 --> 07:42.600
we may be able to assist you.

07:42.630 --> 07:43.159
Yes.

07:48.190 --> 07:50.320
If you can still stand after three days

07:50.360 --> 07:51.720
of training under me,

07:52.310 --> 07:53.840
I'll teach you some skills.

07:55.510 --> 07:55.920
Okay.

07:56.480 --> 07:58.430
1,996.

07:58.430 --> 08:00.340
1,997.

08:00.430 --> 08:02.660
1,998.

08:02.920 --> 08:05.870
1,999.

08:05.870 --> 08:06.920
2,000!

08:10.290 --> 08:11.890
Cultivate spiritual power.

08:12.190 --> 08:13.600
Train your physical body.

08:13.600 --> 08:14.120
Train!

08:14.510 --> 08:16.990
Attack, and your strength will double.

08:17.240 --> 08:19.540
Defend, and you can withstand blows.

08:19.920 --> 08:20.630
Remember this:

08:20.630 --> 08:22.600
Might makes right!

08:23.190 --> 08:25.400
Might makes right!

08:25.560 --> 08:27.680
Might makes right!

08:27.750 --> 08:29.870
Might makes right!

08:30.040 --> 08:32.200
Might makes right!

08:32.200 --> 08:34.240
Might makes right!

08:34.240 --> 08:36.360
Might makes right!

08:36.390 --> 08:38.630
Might makes right!

08:38.630 --> 08:39.630
You are right!

08:39.630 --> 08:40.850
You are right!

08:40.909 --> 08:41.840
Senior.

08:44.000 --> 08:45.150
This is Bamboo's second uncle.

08:45.150 --> 08:46.280
I brought it for you.

08:48.430 --> 08:49.880
Remove the bottom part.

09:05.120 --> 09:05.480
Done.

09:16.670 --> 09:18.130
Let me teach you a new game.

09:18.410 --> 09:19.070
It's called

09:19.330 --> 09:20.190
Ju.

09:22.880 --> 09:24.940
Without using spiritual power,

09:25.030 --> 09:27.030
you must throw the ball

09:28.550 --> 09:29.880
into that basket to win.

09:30.030 --> 09:31.120
And if I win?

09:32.000 --> 09:32.730
If you win...

09:33.200 --> 09:34.000
if you win,

09:34.670 --> 09:36.000
I'll grant you one wish.

09:45.880 --> 09:46.440
Wait.

09:47.270 --> 09:49.600
I haven't finished explaining the rules.

09:49.870 --> 09:51.670
I won't use spiritual power either,

09:51.670 --> 09:52.270
but I'll

09:52.350 --> 09:53.990
try my best to stop you.

09:54.720 --> 09:55.840
Are you ready?

10:01.840 --> 10:02.790
My mother said

10:02.790 --> 10:04.920
that those who love to laugh are lucky.

10:06.360 --> 10:07.390
That doesn't count.

10:07.390 --> 10:07.990
Try again.

10:10.750 --> 10:11.210
Come on.

10:11.670 --> 10:12.870
Alright, here I come.

10:19.120 --> 10:20.440
Again!

10:21.080 --> 10:21.690
Go!

10:42.790 --> 10:43.400
Look.

10:48.600 --> 10:49.690
Amazing.

10:55.000 --> 10:56.400
I'll spare you this time.

10:56.440 --> 10:57.700
Go back and tell Hong Ye

10:58.080 --> 10:59.960
that if he wants to
attempt an assassination,

10:59.960 --> 11:01.750
he should send more capable people.

11:01.750 --> 11:02.480
No, no.

11:02.910 --> 11:04.240
You've misunderstood.

11:05.870 --> 11:06.960
Well, we...

11:07.030 --> 11:08.550
We just wanted to learn from

11:08.550 --> 11:10.080
your extraordinary poise.

11:10.080 --> 11:10.680
No, I mean—

11:11.270 --> 11:12.000
your integrity.

11:12.000 --> 11:12.550
Yes.

11:12.550 --> 11:13.560
For bamboo,

11:13.720 --> 11:15.720
integrity is of the utmost importance.

11:15.720 --> 11:16.550
Yes.

11:16.790 --> 11:18.150
Whatever you plan to do,

11:18.730 --> 11:20.760
keep at least ten zhang away from me.

11:22.000 --> 11:23.410
Do not let Xiao Yao
misunderstand anything.

11:23.410 --> 11:25.410
Otherwise, I will kill you on sight.

11:26.240 --> 11:29.360
As long as I stay more than ten zhang away,
I can follow you, right?

11:29.360 --> 11:30.080
Ten zhang.

11:31.360 --> 11:33.390
Ten is enough.
I can follow you now, right?

11:33.390 --> 11:34.200
My Lord!

11:34.630 --> 11:36.240
My Lord, something terrible has happened!

11:36.240 --> 11:38.570
You need to do something
about it, My Lord!

11:38.630 --> 11:39.320
My Lord.

11:39.550 --> 11:40.550
What's so urgent?

11:41.320 --> 11:42.510
Those three ancient demons

11:42.510 --> 11:44.200
are buying loyalty everywhere.

11:44.200 --> 11:45.600
If this continues,

11:45.600 --> 11:46.720
all the minor and inexperienced demons

11:46.720 --> 11:48.450
will fall under their control.

11:48.550 --> 11:50.270
You're making a fuss over nothing.

11:50.270 --> 11:51.790
I'm really not.

11:51.870 --> 11:53.470
Go take a look and you'll see.

11:53.670 --> 11:54.360
Hurry!

11:54.550 --> 11:55.600
Let's go, My Lord!

11:59.320 --> 12:01.450
Whoever can lay so much as a finger on me

12:01.890 --> 12:04.150
will be granted
a hundred years of cultivation.

12:04.150 --> 12:04.600
What?

12:04.600 --> 12:05.120
Really?

12:05.120 --> 12:05.600
What?

12:05.840 --> 12:07.480
-A hundred years?
-A hundred years of cultivation?

12:07.480 --> 12:07.870
A hundred years!

12:07.870 --> 12:08.440
One,

12:08.440 --> 12:09.030
two,

12:09.030 --> 12:09.750
pull!

12:11.360 --> 12:12.030
My Lord,

12:12.270 --> 12:13.570
look at them.

12:13.720 --> 12:14.910
They're supposed to be training,

12:14.910 --> 12:15.600
yet here they are fooling around

12:15.600 --> 12:17.200
with this useless nonsense.

12:17.790 --> 12:18.520
Pull harder!

12:18.750 --> 12:20.000
I am trying!

12:20.720 --> 12:21.980
Did you skip your meal?

12:22.790 --> 12:23.390
Harder!

12:24.600 --> 12:25.200
Harder!

12:25.200 --> 12:25.910
One, two,

12:25.910 --> 12:26.720
pull!

12:27.120 --> 12:28.830
One, two, pull!

12:29.010 --> 12:31.040
One, two, pull!

12:31.200 --> 12:32.900
Training physical strength like this

12:32.900 --> 12:34.700
isn't such a bad thing after all.

12:38.480 --> 12:39.370
My Lord.

12:42.030 --> 12:42.960
Look over there.

12:46.870 --> 12:47.480
Again!

12:59.720 --> 13:00.340
Forget it,

13:02.440 --> 13:03.840
just tell me your wish.

13:13.120 --> 13:14.910
Since Dali left,

13:16.790 --> 13:18.720
I haven't had any friends.

13:20.720 --> 13:22.800
No one wants to play with me.

13:22.840 --> 13:24.790
I'm unhappy every day.

13:29.080 --> 13:31.330
But just now,
when I was playing with you, Senior,

13:31.330 --> 13:33.130
it felt like I had a friend again.

13:37.670 --> 13:39.150
So let's keep going.

13:45.750 --> 13:47.510
You said it yourself.

13:49.480 --> 13:50.030
This time

13:52.000 --> 13:52.860
it's my turn!

14:12.240 --> 14:13.440
How can there be

14:14.390 --> 14:16.930
a demon lord with such overwhelming power?

14:17.020 --> 14:18.240
Indeed.

14:18.870 --> 14:22.180
The way he concentrates on
his work is mesmerizing.

14:22.270 --> 14:23.910
Yes.

14:25.060 --> 14:27.560
They're clearly old-fashioned
fabric and patterns,

14:27.560 --> 14:29.030
yet on him

14:29.030 --> 14:30.590
they look extraordinary.

14:33.340 --> 14:35.100
You're too young to get it.

14:35.600 --> 14:37.080
This is called classical style.

14:37.080 --> 14:38.070
Classical?

14:38.320 --> 14:39.380
Classical beauty.

14:54.150 --> 14:54.750
I...

14:56.630 --> 14:59.290
I never imagined that
after ten thousand years,

14:59.410 --> 15:00.770
styles could change

15:00.840 --> 15:01.960
so much.

15:02.810 --> 15:04.530
Demon Lord, this is my

15:04.580 --> 15:05.360
hair.

15:09.470 --> 15:10.800
It looks so beautiful.

15:11.790 --> 15:12.870
Lift your head.

15:14.510 --> 15:15.770
Stretch out your arms.

15:17.630 --> 15:18.480
A bit higher.

15:19.950 --> 15:21.360
That's beautiful.

15:21.430 --> 15:22.430
It suits you well.

15:24.000 --> 15:25.750
Bamboo, he's complimenting you.

15:25.750 --> 15:26.510
My Lord,

15:26.510 --> 15:27.240
look at this.

15:27.960 --> 15:29.720
My Lord, please wait for me.

15:29.720 --> 15:31.030
My Lord, there's no need to worry.

15:31.030 --> 15:32.080
Xiao Ming and Xiao Mu

15:32.080 --> 15:33.860
will always be by your side.

15:34.240 --> 15:35.750
Your spiritual power
has only just recovered,

15:35.750 --> 15:37.600
so please make sure to rest more.

15:38.360 --> 15:40.600
They're just a few ancient demons
from ten thousand years ago.

15:40.600 --> 15:42.530
What is there for me to worry about?

15:43.960 --> 15:46.030
Haven't I already seen everything
you wanted to show me?

15:46.030 --> 15:47.390
Why are you still following me?

15:47.390 --> 15:47.790
I...

15:49.000 --> 15:49.840
Why are you here?

15:49.840 --> 15:50.370
Xiao Yao.

15:52.840 --> 15:53.960
Take care of yourself, My Lord.

15:53.960 --> 15:55.000
I came to see you.

15:56.510 --> 15:57.640
What smells so good?

15:58.390 --> 15:59.990
I made some flower pastries.

16:01.670 --> 16:03.610
Ao Hen, Qiong Qi, and Teng She

16:03.670 --> 16:05.080
did a great job repairing the barrier.

16:05.080 --> 16:06.670
I want to invite them
to try these flower pastries

16:06.670 --> 16:07.750
to show my gratitude.

16:07.750 --> 16:08.670
You came at the right time.

16:08.670 --> 16:09.730
Let's go find them.

16:10.670 --> 16:12.400
Those three are ancient beasts

16:12.670 --> 16:15.130
and can be extremely cruel
when they go wild.

16:16.200 --> 16:17.440
Well, Xiao Mu once said

16:17.440 --> 16:19.500
I would bring disaster to the demons.

16:21.080 --> 16:22.200
I can tell

16:22.440 --> 16:24.270
they bear no ill will toward the demons.

16:24.270 --> 16:26.000
But they have feelings for you.

16:30.600 --> 16:31.510
So,

16:31.910 --> 16:35.320
are you afraid they'll harm
the demons, or...

16:35.320 --> 16:35.840
Yes,

16:36.270 --> 16:37.150
I'm jealous.

16:40.680 --> 16:41.870
If I hadn't heard it with my own ears,

16:41.870 --> 16:44.140
I wouldn't believe you'd say that.

16:45.630 --> 16:46.910
I used to think

16:47.640 --> 16:49.750
that as long as my spiritual power
was strong enough,

16:49.750 --> 16:51.200
there was nothing in this world

16:51.200 --> 16:52.670
I needed to fear.

16:54.150 --> 16:55.120
But after I met you,

16:55.120 --> 16:56.080
I realized

16:57.390 --> 16:59.520
that even the strongest can be afraid.

17:00.510 --> 17:01.910
I'm afraid of losing you.

17:02.390 --> 17:04.050
I'm afraid you might get hurt,

17:04.069 --> 17:06.130
and even more afraid that those three

17:07.290 --> 17:09.290
might join forces and take you away.

17:10.160 --> 17:12.020
Even if I fought with all my might,

17:12.640 --> 17:14.300
I still couldn't get you back.

17:38.970 --> 17:40.170
Are you still afraid?

17:42.350 --> 17:42.790
Hmm.

17:43.200 --> 17:43.720
Yes.

17:46.440 --> 17:48.030
Alright, let's be serious.

17:48.050 --> 17:49.980
Come, let's go find them together.

17:50.310 --> 17:50.840
Let's go.

17:55.030 --> 17:56.160
Demon Lord,

17:56.590 --> 17:58.310
those who benefit the demons
deserve rewards,

17:58.310 --> 18:00.030
and those who harm them
deserve punishment.

18:00.030 --> 18:01.110
They worked hard

18:01.110 --> 18:02.440
repairing the barrier.

18:03.350 --> 18:05.430
They deserve some appreciation.

18:09.510 --> 18:10.590
Aren't you coming?

18:13.270 --> 18:14.530
Then I'll go by myself.

18:16.270 --> 18:16.920
I'm off.

18:20.680 --> 18:22.080
You're really not going?

18:30.000 --> 18:31.400
You're really not going?

18:50.570 --> 18:51.790
Did you make all these?

18:51.790 --> 18:52.110
Yes.

18:52.110 --> 18:54.170
Whatever you make must be delicious.

19:03.200 --> 19:04.720
It's so delicious.

19:05.310 --> 19:06.030
I declare

19:06.310 --> 19:07.240
this is the most

19:07.240 --> 19:08.900
delicious thing in the world.

19:13.440 --> 19:14.240
Ao Hen,

19:14.510 --> 19:16.440
These flower pastries
won't last for ten thousand years.

19:16.440 --> 19:18.310
Don't tell me you want to
plant them in the ground

19:18.310 --> 19:19.440
so they'll grow into
flower trees next year.

19:19.440 --> 19:20.400
What do you know?

19:20.400 --> 19:22.240
These flower pastries
were made by Xiao Yao,

19:22.240 --> 19:23.400
so of course I need to keep them

19:23.400 --> 19:24.730
to enjoy them properly.

19:26.210 --> 19:29.030
-Enjoy them properly.
-To thank the three of you
for your hard work,

19:29.030 --> 19:31.760
these flower pastries
were made by me and Hong Ye.

19:35.550 --> 19:36.310
Hong Ye,

19:36.520 --> 19:37.850
come out and eat with us.

19:45.140 --> 19:48.270
Do you really think I'll come
just because you called me?

20:01.680 --> 20:03.960
No matter what grievances
we've had before,

20:03.960 --> 20:05.680
we demons are one family.

20:05.920 --> 20:07.450
I offer tea instead of wine,

20:07.590 --> 20:10.250
and consider
our misunderstandings resolved.

20:28.850 --> 20:29.780
Go ahead and eat.

20:35.080 --> 20:36.050
This is mine.

20:39.030 --> 20:40.240
You're not worthy

20:40.750 --> 20:41.810
of sharing with us.

20:45.360 --> 20:47.000
My sister worked hard to make these.

20:47.000 --> 20:47.750
Don't you dare

20:47.750 --> 20:48.830
ruin them.

20:49.830 --> 20:51.470
You've already eaten so much.
You're still eating?

20:51.470 --> 20:52.830
Sister likes watching me eat.

20:52.830 --> 20:54.880
She already told you
not to call her "Sister" anymore.

20:54.880 --> 20:55.750
I'll call her whatever I want.

20:55.750 --> 20:58.030
It's none of your business, you big oaf.

20:58.790 --> 20:59.540
Teng She,

20:59.720 --> 21:02.160
don't think I don't see through
your little schemes.

21:02.160 --> 21:04.890
Stop hiding behind the
brother-and-sister act.

21:05.160 --> 21:06.440
You're always the most scheming one,

21:06.440 --> 21:08.550
and you've got the nerve
to say that about me?

21:08.550 --> 21:09.200
Hong Ye,

21:09.800 --> 21:11.200
this is all because of you.

21:11.200 --> 21:11.930
Let go.

21:20.440 --> 21:21.220
I said

21:21.310 --> 21:22.550
I'd be the one to kill Hong Ye.

21:22.550 --> 21:23.550
Everyone, let go!

21:34.030 --> 21:35.440
All of you stop!

21:44.070 --> 21:45.730
-Sister.
-Don't call me that.

21:46.480 --> 21:47.820
Aren't you all tired?

21:48.550 --> 21:49.200
Xiao Yao,

21:49.270 --> 21:50.510
I've never forced you

21:51.110 --> 21:52.970
to do anything you didn't want to.

21:53.240 --> 21:53.920
But today, when I saw you

21:53.920 --> 21:55.850
look at him with such infatuation,

21:56.000 --> 21:57.400
I just couldn't stand it.

21:58.270 --> 21:59.440
Since we met,

22:00.440 --> 22:02.310
you've acted like
you don't know us at all,

22:02.310 --> 22:04.440
only desperately protecting Hong Ye.

22:04.720 --> 22:06.770
Aren't you curious about your past?

22:08.070 --> 22:09.060
Don't you want to ask

22:09.060 --> 22:10.640
why we just came out of Yunmeng Lake

22:10.640 --> 22:12.790
and immediately wanted to
settle scores with him?

22:12.790 --> 22:14.160
I truly don't understand

22:14.160 --> 22:15.960
whether you genuinely don't know,

22:15.960 --> 22:17.920
or if you're pretending
not to know just so you can stay with him.

22:17.920 --> 22:19.900
I don't want to know about the past.

22:20.200 --> 22:21.830
Ten thousand years have passed.

22:21.830 --> 22:22.750
The world

22:22.920 --> 22:24.070
has already changed.

22:24.070 --> 22:25.680
How could I not have changed?

22:26.590 --> 22:27.110
You...

22:27.590 --> 22:28.110
Yes,

22:28.310 --> 22:30.000
it's been over ten thousand years,

22:30.000 --> 22:31.830
but your personality
hasn't changed at all.

22:31.830 --> 22:32.640
How do you explain that?

22:32.640 --> 22:33.750
Doesn't that prove

22:34.230 --> 22:36.230
that my choice won't change either?

22:42.920 --> 22:43.910
I was hoping

22:44.350 --> 22:46.000
to have a proper conversation
with you all.

22:46.000 --> 22:47.030
But now I see

22:47.030 --> 22:49.090
there's no point in talking further.

22:51.070 --> 22:52.200
Tonight is the night

22:52.350 --> 22:54.810
Xiao Yao and I
will consummate our marriage.

22:55.410 --> 22:56.980
Consummate your marriage?

22:57.460 --> 22:59.790
No matter what we went through
in the past,

23:01.680 --> 23:03.810
she is the woman I will marry in the end.

23:04.880 --> 23:05.510
When did

23:06.680 --> 23:07.810
you two get married?

23:09.270 --> 23:10.400
A hundred years ago.

23:13.710 --> 23:14.960
No matter how much time passes,

23:14.960 --> 23:16.520
no matter what we go through,

23:16.520 --> 23:17.820
the man I will marry

23:18.110 --> 23:19.110
is Hong Ye.

23:34.310 --> 23:37.250
I waited for you in Yunmeng Lake
for ten thousand years.

23:37.250 --> 23:38.450
Why couldn't you wait

23:39.190 --> 23:40.630
even a mere hundred?

23:42.890 --> 23:44.510
Then let today's flower pastries

23:44.510 --> 23:46.670
serve as our wedding pastries.

23:46.960 --> 23:48.790
Since the three of you
have already eaten them,

23:48.790 --> 23:51.480
don't bring up what happened
ten thousand years ago again.

23:51.480 --> 23:52.400
Let us go,

23:52.400 --> 23:54.060
and spare yourselves as well.

23:54.920 --> 23:56.180
Wedding pastries?

23:59.640 --> 24:00.210
Pah!

24:01.110 --> 24:02.270
Filthy things!

24:03.960 --> 24:04.440
I...

24:04.590 --> 24:05.160
Pah!

24:05.590 --> 24:06.650
Wedding pastries?

24:11.510 --> 24:13.370
The mortal world is truly filthy.

24:15.240 --> 24:16.790
It's only been a few days,

24:19.480 --> 24:21.410
and I already have lines on my face.

24:21.550 --> 24:22.310
Not at all,

24:22.680 --> 24:23.740
Exalted Immortal.

24:24.000 --> 24:25.240
Your skin is as smooth as jade,

24:25.240 --> 24:26.480
and your flesh is like ice and bone.

24:26.480 --> 24:28.210
Even my fingertips slip

24:28.400 --> 24:29.930
slip when I touch your skin.

24:31.110 --> 24:32.710
If the war were not so urgent,

24:34.510 --> 24:36.110
what reason would there be

24:39.000 --> 24:40.860
to linger in such a tainted place?

24:41.960 --> 24:42.640
Yes.

24:43.510 --> 24:44.790
His Majesty and all the consorts

24:44.790 --> 24:47.270
are deeply grateful
for your great kindness.

24:47.270 --> 24:48.640
The consorts of every palace

24:48.640 --> 24:50.680
have offered up their
personal cosmetics and adornments.

24:50.680 --> 24:52.610
Please, choose whatever you like.

25:17.030 --> 25:18.080
I deserve death,

25:18.110 --> 25:19.370
yet I beg you for mercy.

25:19.720 --> 25:21.920
Just now, I was truly frightened.

25:22.070 --> 25:23.830
The person who prepared
this box of hairpins

25:23.830 --> 25:25.240
is extremely malicious.

25:25.680 --> 25:27.550
You must not use these, Exalted Immortal.

25:27.550 --> 25:28.590
The designs

25:28.590 --> 25:29.680
of these hairpins

25:29.680 --> 25:30.640
are based on

25:31.000 --> 25:31.920
the phoenix tail,

25:31.920 --> 25:32.750
silk orchids,

25:33.110 --> 25:34.270
and dragon's blood flowers—

25:34.270 --> 25:35.870
all symbolizing longevity.

25:35.920 --> 25:38.380
Only elders of advanced age
would wear them.

25:38.400 --> 25:39.830
You are merely sixteen,

25:40.110 --> 25:41.310
in the prime of youth.

25:41.310 --> 25:42.570
To display such things

25:44.030 --> 25:45.160
is truly...

25:47.480 --> 25:48.550
Which consort

25:49.270 --> 25:51.110
sent this dressing case?

25:51.720 --> 25:53.750
The Exalted Immortal is speaking to you.

25:53.750 --> 25:54.880
The Western Palace.

25:55.350 --> 25:59.030
Was it the Consort of the Western Palace
herself who prepared this dressing case?

25:59.030 --> 26:00.720
I truly don't know.

26:00.920 --> 26:03.510
The Emperor always praises
the Consort of the Western Palace for her wisdom.

26:03.510 --> 26:04.830
All matters in the inner palace,

26:04.830 --> 26:05.880
great and small,

26:05.880 --> 26:08.060
are decided by her alone.

26:08.790 --> 26:10.300
Surely it was an unintentional oversight

26:10.300 --> 26:11.790
on her part.

26:12.030 --> 26:13.160
Exalted Immortal, I beg you

26:13.160 --> 26:14.310
to show leniency,

26:14.310 --> 26:15.860
considering the Consort's

26:16.030 --> 26:17.550
unparalleled beauty and grace.

26:17.550 --> 26:19.350
Unparalleled beauty and grace?

26:23.720 --> 26:25.580
Is she truly that stunning?

26:25.880 --> 26:27.940
Of course, she cannot compare to you.

26:28.160 --> 26:30.090
But within the Tiansheng Kingdom,

26:30.310 --> 26:32.170
the Consort of the Western Palace

26:32.430 --> 26:34.720
is indeed regarded as foremost in beauty.

26:34.720 --> 26:35.660
Yanlan,

26:37.720 --> 26:39.320
which palace do you serve in?

26:41.520 --> 26:42.400
I

26:43.790 --> 26:45.650
have served in the Eastern Palace

26:46.060 --> 26:47.440
since childhood.

26:51.350 --> 26:54.790
At this critical juncture
of life and death for the nation,

26:55.820 --> 26:56.680
how dare you drag me into

26:56.680 --> 26:58.610
the intrigues of the inner palace?

27:03.340 --> 27:05.100
Tell your master

27:06.730 --> 27:08.190
to give me an explanation!

27:09.270 --> 27:09.940
Exalted Immortal,

27:09.940 --> 27:11.070
I'm clumsy with words

27:11.070 --> 27:12.000
and slow-witted,

27:12.000 --> 27:13.140
and I have offended you.

27:13.140 --> 27:14.480
But this matter truly has nothing to do

27:14.480 --> 27:15.640
with my lady.

27:16.220 --> 27:18.420
Please be merciful, Exalted Immortal.

27:50.240 --> 27:51.500
I spoke carelessly

27:51.610 --> 27:53.540
and angered the Exalted Immortal.

27:54.280 --> 27:56.210
will punish myself to appease you.

28:19.170 --> 28:20.370
All of you, withdraw.

28:33.750 --> 28:35.440
Who have you truly become now?

29:15.250 --> 29:18.530
♪ Fear that the red thread that bound us,
the vows we engraved ♪

29:18.720 --> 29:19.960
Xiao Yao and His Lordship have arrived!

29:19.620 --> 29:22.840
♪ The "forever" we swore are
meant to miss their mark ♪

29:19.960 --> 29:22.160
Xiao Yao and His Lordship have arrived!

29:27.070 --> 29:29.460
The bright moon
traces the flight of two swans.

29:29.300 --> 29:32.710
♪ Afraid of the exchanged life and death,
the arrows blocking the way ♪

29:29.680 --> 29:32.540
The frost-kissed plum
blossoms stand side by side.

29:32.590 --> 29:33.920
Congratulations to
My Lord and Xiao Yao

29:33.580 --> 29:37.870
♪ The chains that are hard to break,
hard to distinguish ♪

29:33.920 --> 29:36.650
on your union—
a perfect match blessed by heaven.

29:39.160 --> 29:40.920
May My Lord and Xiao Yao

29:40.920 --> 29:42.200
grow old together in harmony,

29:41.270 --> 29:43.600
♪ Perhaps it's all for nothing ♪

29:42.200 --> 29:43.510
sharing endless years of joy and love.

29:43.510 --> 29:45.110
May you grow old together in harmony,

29:44.720 --> 29:46.980
♪ Love and hate are nothing more ♪

29:45.110 --> 29:46.800
sharing endless years of joy and love.

29:46.800 --> 29:49.270
May you share endless years
of joy and love.

29:48.020 --> 29:52.290
♪ Than a scene we rush through ♪

29:49.270 --> 29:52.030
Grow old together in harmony,
sharing endless years of joy and love.

29:52.030 --> 29:55.030
Grow old together in harmony,
sharing endless years of joy and love.

29:55.030 --> 29:57.750
Grow old together in harmony,
sharing endless years of joy and love.

29:55.520 --> 29:57.830
♪ Afraid of giving my true heart ♪

29:57.750 --> 29:58.510
Give me some.

29:58.760 --> 30:01.250
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

29:59.310 --> 30:00.670
Take your hands off.

30:01.000 --> 30:04.340
Grow old together in harmony,
endless years of joy and love.

30:03.650 --> 30:05.720
♪ Boiling hot ♪

30:04.370 --> 30:07.720
Grow old together in harmony,
endless years of joy and love.

30:10.420 --> 30:14.740
♪ You and I are like grass and trees
meeting in the depths of the clouds ♪

30:10.830 --> 30:11.860
To the bridal chamber!

30:11.860 --> 30:12.730
To the bridal chamber!

30:12.730 --> 30:13.690
To the bridal chamber!

30:13.690 --> 30:14.600
To the bridal chamber!

30:14.600 --> 30:15.670
To the bridal chamber!

30:15.610 --> 30:19.990
♪ Like the red thread strung together,
hanging on a sharp sword ♪

30:15.690 --> 30:16.650
To the bridal chamber!

30:16.650 --> 30:17.760
To the bridal chamber!

30:17.760 --> 30:19.680
To the bridal chamber!

30:19.700 --> 30:21.130
To the bridal chamber!

30:20.970 --> 30:23.820
♪ Waiting for the heartbeat
to shatter time ♪

30:21.160 --> 30:23.150
To the bridal chamber!

30:23.170 --> 30:25.920
To the bridal chamber!

30:25.020 --> 30:26.410
♪ The chains of fate ♪

30:25.940 --> 30:27.200
To the bridal chamber!

30:27.420 --> 30:30.980
♪ Belong to us, in the blink of an eye,
it's 1,000 years ♪

30:31.970 --> 30:35.600
♪ You and I meet across mountains
and rivers, under the bright moon ♪

30:36.400 --> 30:37.880
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

30:39.020 --> 30:40.390
♪ Both flushing ♪

30:41.380 --> 30:45.020
♪ Waiting to walk hand in hand
through the chessboard of fate ♪

30:46.030 --> 30:50.950
♪ The carefree moments that belong to us ♪

30:47.640 --> 30:48.900
You can put me down now.

30:49.640 --> 30:50.770
We're not there yet.

30:53.320 --> 30:55.190
♪ Moments ♪

31:02.330 --> 31:04.770
♪ The armor I dare not cast away ♪

31:05.770 --> 31:08.260
♪ The red cheeks ♪

31:10.220 --> 31:11.790
♪ Cold ♪

31:11.600 --> 31:13.310
After a century of wandering and waiting,

31:13.310 --> 31:14.970
this day has finally arrived.

31:15.990 --> 31:17.300
Even now,

31:16.550 --> 31:18.960
♪ I'm afraid it's a dream ♪

31:17.990 --> 31:18.990
I still feel like

31:19.240 --> 31:20.550
I'm dreaming.

31:20.040 --> 31:21.690
♪ A thousand years is just ♪

31:22.000 --> 31:22.680
From this day forward,

31:22.560 --> 31:27.310
♪ A fleeting moment's grand display ♪

31:25.070 --> 31:27.440
I'll accompany you through a life
of unrestrained joy and freedom.

31:27.440 --> 31:28.680
Would that be acceptable to you?

31:28.680 --> 31:30.010
I couldn't ask for more.

31:31.440 --> 31:35.720
♪ You and I are like grass and trees
meeting in the depths of the clouds ♪

31:36.720 --> 31:41.060
♪ Like the red thread strung together,
hanging on a sharp sword ♪

31:42.120 --> 31:44.870
♪ Waiting for the heartbeat
to shatter time ♪

31:45.940 --> 31:47.440
♪ The chains of fate ♪

31:48.400 --> 31:52.180
♪ Belong to us, in the blink of an eye,
it's 1,000 years ♪

31:52.930 --> 31:56.690
♪ You and I meet across mountains
and rivers, under the bright moon ♪

31:57.540 --> 31:59.000
♪ The obsession that rises like magpies ♪

32:00.070 --> 32:01.580
♪ Both flushing ♪

32:02.520 --> 32:06.130
♪ Waiting to walk hand in hand
through the chessboard of fate ♪

32:07.060 --> 32:12.190
♪ The carefree moments that belong to us ♪

32:09.080 --> 32:11.280
Why is this fragment of the mirror here?

32:12.710 --> 32:14.770
This piece is "Love and Separation."

32:15.520 --> 32:18.970
♪ Moments ♪

32:17.070 --> 32:20.530
The obsession that has lingered
in my heart for a hundred years

32:20.900 --> 32:22.560
has finally been laid to rest.

32:28.160 --> 32:30.220
All that has passed is but a prologue.

32:31.310 --> 32:33.240
From now on, we will stay together,

32:33.880 --> 32:34.750
never to part.

33:00.590 --> 33:01.390
What's wrong?

33:02.310 --> 33:03.480
Did you hear something?

33:03.480 --> 33:05.110
You're stepping on my foot!

33:05.200 --> 33:06.060
Move over a bit.

33:10.240 --> 33:10.960
Be quiet.

33:10.990 --> 33:11.590
Let me listen.

33:11.590 --> 33:12.390
Don't push me.

33:13.070 --> 33:13.440
I...

33:19.030 --> 33:20.090
What are you doing?

33:22.310 --> 33:22.880
Hurry!

33:24.590 --> 33:25.200
What are you doing?

33:25.200 --> 33:26.110
I'm eavesdropping.

33:26.110 --> 33:26.920
Does it sound good?

33:26.920 --> 33:27.750
Yes, it is!

33:27.750 --> 33:28.240
Do you enjoy it?

33:28.240 --> 33:28.880
I love it!

33:28.880 --> 33:29.590
Are you still listening?

33:29.590 --> 33:30.310
Of course!

33:30.310 --> 33:31.310
Let me listen too.

33:39.400 --> 33:40.060
How stupid.

33:41.750 --> 33:42.550
Are you smart?

33:43.240 --> 33:44.100
Thank you, Sir.

34:00.400 --> 34:00.800
No way.

34:01.400 --> 34:02.860
How could I do such a thing?

34:03.030 --> 34:03.680
Honestly!

34:09.230 --> 34:10.630
Don't feel bad about it.

34:11.150 --> 34:11.860
Let me tell you,

34:11.860 --> 34:14.230
whether it's eavesdropping or peeping,

34:14.400 --> 34:16.070
we should wait outside for His Lordship

34:16.070 --> 34:17.670
for such an important event.

34:18.070 --> 34:18.920
Do you agree?

34:41.520 --> 34:43.780
I never thought they'd still be together

34:45.550 --> 34:47.280
even after ten thousand years.

34:50.190 --> 34:51.159
So,

34:51.280 --> 34:53.550
why are we still here

34:54.320 --> 34:55.150
anyway?

34:57.650 --> 34:59.050
What's the use of crying?

35:00.480 --> 35:01.880
If she sees you like this,

35:03.250 --> 35:04.850
she'll only despise you more

35:05.400 --> 35:07.200
and drift further away from you.

35:13.760 --> 35:14.510
Hong Ye,

35:14.920 --> 35:16.370
you coward!

35:16.710 --> 35:19.820
-You don't even dare to fight me head-on.
-You fought a lot.

35:19.820 --> 35:20.880
Did Sister ever say

35:20.920 --> 35:22.760
she'd like you if you won?

35:23.280 --> 35:24.710
Even if she doesn't like me,

35:24.710 --> 35:26.910
I can't let that Hong Ye take advantage.

35:27.880 --> 35:29.210
I can't let him have her.

35:31.360 --> 35:32.290
Get out of my way.

35:33.960 --> 35:34.480
Move!

35:34.480 --> 35:36.280
You're going to pick a fight with Hong Ye?

35:36.280 --> 35:36.930
Of course.

35:36.960 --> 35:38.450
They're already married.

35:38.760 --> 35:39.920
If you hurt Hong Ye now,

35:39.920 --> 35:41.030
you're hurting Sister.

35:41.030 --> 35:42.780
I won't allow you to hurt her!

35:43.760 --> 35:44.400
Teng She,

35:45.190 --> 35:46.760
whose side are you on?

35:46.790 --> 35:47.990
I'm on Sister's side.

35:49.360 --> 35:50.620
As long as she's happy,

35:51.030 --> 35:52.560
even if it breaks my heart,

35:53.760 --> 35:55.820
I'll protect her choice till the end.

35:57.590 --> 35:59.620
What if Hong Ye's affection is just

35:59.880 --> 36:01.960
as false as it was ten millennia ago,

36:01.960 --> 36:04.020
and his motives are just as ulterior?

36:06.230 --> 36:08.150
Are you truly willing to stand by

36:08.730 --> 36:10.530
and watch her be betrayed again?

36:12.230 --> 36:13.510
If Xiao Yao knew

36:13.510 --> 36:16.170
what Hong Ye truly did to her
all those years ago,

36:16.280 --> 36:18.540
she would never have agreed to marry him.

36:21.230 --> 36:22.040
Gentlemen,

36:22.190 --> 36:23.820
if we truly care for her,

36:24.030 --> 36:25.890
the most important thing we can do

36:26.320 --> 36:28.860
is to reveal Hong Ye's true nature—

36:29.320 --> 36:30.880
to let her see it clearly
and make her own choice again.

36:30.880 --> 36:32.400
It's not that simple.

36:32.670 --> 36:33.920
No matter what we say now,

36:33.920 --> 36:35.280
Sister doesn't want to listen

36:35.280 --> 36:36.080
or believe us.

36:37.480 --> 36:38.340
Then let us form

36:39.510 --> 36:41.380
a Time-Reversal Array.

36:42.280 --> 36:44.280
That's exactly what I was thinking.

37:05.880 --> 37:08.090
♪ The Three-Life Stone cracks,
unleashing the light of three lifetimes ♪

37:09.690 --> 37:11.620
♪ Shattering the window of
the mortal world ♪

37:13.160 --> 37:15.270
♪ The unity knot loosens,
unlocking the lock of togetherness ♪

37:16.690 --> 37:18.260
♪ Tasting the scalding flow of life ♪

37:19.620 --> 37:22.680
♪ Moss traces creep along
the corridor of reincarnation ♪

37:24.050 --> 37:25.350
♪ The door ring echoes ♪

37:26.840 --> 37:28.040
♪ The River of Forgetfulness
flows backward ♪

37:29.210 --> 37:32.200
♪ Streaming across your eyes ♪

37:32.360 --> 37:33.640
The seasonings aren't fully stocked,

37:33.640 --> 37:35.560
♪ The tides push the waves ♪

37:34.320 --> 37:36.330
and the flour isn't as good as the kind
from Pingjiang Prefecture.

37:36.330 --> 37:37.310
It's the best I can do for now.

37:36.410 --> 37:37.580
♪ The rings of years keep growing ♪

37:37.550 --> 37:38.540
Go ahead, have a taste.

37:38.540 --> 37:40.070
♪ The heart knocks with
the weight of time ♪

37:40.820 --> 37:42.390
♪ The hair starts to turn grey ♪

37:43.460 --> 37:46.570
♪ Frost forms on the brow bones ♪

37:48.460 --> 37:52.160
♪ Flames of the burning heart
cook the fragrance of a bygone world ♪

37:49.620 --> 37:50.350
How is it?

37:52.870 --> 37:54.860
♪ Dreams break like begonia blossoms ♪

37:53.670 --> 37:54.840
This is the third best bowl of noodles

37:54.840 --> 37:56.110
I've ever had.

37:55.700 --> 37:57.680
♪ Rising against the torrent ♪

37:57.540 --> 37:58.750
And what about the second best?

37:58.520 --> 38:01.820
♪ Turning the account of impermanence ♪

37:59.440 --> 38:00.930
That would be the bowl

38:01.480 --> 38:03.340
from Xu's Noodles on my birthday.

38:03.590 --> 38:04.110
So,

38:04.760 --> 38:06.220
what's the very best then?

38:08.190 --> 38:09.590
The very best

38:09.590 --> 38:10.320
will be

38:12.070 --> 38:14.030
the bowl you make for me tomorrow.

38:18.650 --> 38:20.220
Oh, so you want me

38:20.510 --> 38:22.400
to make noodles for you for a lifetime.

38:22.400 --> 38:22.840
Yes.

38:26.360 --> 38:28.490
Where did you learn these sweet words?

38:30.070 --> 38:31.330
Do I need to learn this?

38:32.980 --> 38:34.980
You're the one who doesn't know how.

38:35.630 --> 38:36.360
My Lord!

38:36.670 --> 38:38.110
My Lord, something terrible has happened!

38:38.110 --> 38:39.800
Three great demons
have occupied Youning Cave.

38:39.800 --> 38:40.840
They're casting spells
and forming arrays inside,

38:40.840 --> 38:43.500
saying they want to
settle scores with Xiao Yao.

38:52.740 --> 38:54.050
Time-Reversal Array.

38:56.960 --> 38:58.070
What are you doing?
